{"id":"rama","lemma":"rama","pos":"noun","rank":3389,"glosses":["branch (woody part of a tree arising from the trunk and usually dividing)","offshoot (that which develops from something else)"],"ipa":"/ˈrama/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"ramas"},"order":3392,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/43/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-rama.wav","examples":[{"text":"He cortado una rama del árbol.","en":"I cut a branch from the tree.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/553780","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"choppy, disconnected"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"tree"}]},{"text":"El gato se escondió entre las ramas.","en":"The cat hid among the branches.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/705341","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"cat"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to hide","l":"esconder"},{"g":"between"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"Escuché crujir una rama.","en":"I heard a twig crack.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/353489","words":[{"g":"to listen to","l":"escuchar"},{"g":"to creak, to crack"},{"g":"a"},null]}]}